        <mxCell id="notes" value="&lt;b&gt;Notes&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;*1 Write local, put the cross-cloud dependency on the read side&lt;br&gt;A write path that crosses clouds couples ingest to the remote API.&lt;br&gt;*2 A FlexCache Cache cannot take an S3 Access Point&lt;br&gt;To serve over the S3 API, use a SnapMirror destination.&lt;br&gt;*3 No line is drawn to a non-AWS service&lt;br&gt;Documented by the vendors; no published test record. Reachability is not a working FlexCache." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;strokeColor=#232F3E;fillColor=none;fontColor=#232F3E;fontSize=16;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;spacingTop=8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
